// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
// The Xbox kernel's exports by ordinal: name, the bytes of stack arguments the function pops
// (stdcall), and the kind. Facts of the retail kernel's export table, as xboxrecomp records them
// (tools/xbe_parser KERNEL_EXPORTS for the names, kernel_bridge.c stdcall_args_for_ordinal for
// the argument sizes) and its tools/kernel_audit checks against the export table; the
// data exports are the ones the kernel exports as variables. Generated once; edit by hand.
//
//   WL_XK_EXPORT(ordinal, name, arg_bytes, kind)
//   kind: F stdcall function, R fastcall (ecx, edx; a third argument on the stack, popped:
//   InterlockedCompareExchange), C cdecl varargs (the caller pops), D data
